Diagnosis: the harness is blind — it never executes anything, so silent-zero-result queries (sp0362 LIKE pattern with trailing space, sp0536 wrong literal column/value 'Bachelors', sp0610 title/case mismatch) and schema-misread joins (sp0894 wrong Friend columns) go straight to the grader. All five failures are detectable/repairable with one execution plus one corrective call (budget = 2). Second, weaker pattern hidden by those: output-projection ambiguity ("which countries" → gold returns `*` joined rows, sp0755), which needs an explicit projection rule rather than debugging.

Edits: (1) rewrite solve.py into draft → execute → single repair loop with deterministic empty-result diagnostics (literal existence probe via LIKE '%tok%', LIKE-pattern relaxation probe, FK/column sanity from parsed CREATE statements); (2) system_prompt.md rules for literals, LIKE wildcards, join keys, NOT IN/NULL and "which X" projection; (3) config.json knobs + larger token budget for the reasoning-heavy repair call.

